# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Lead Gen Engine — environment
# Milestone 1 runs fully on MOCK data and a mock cookie session,
# so NO variables are required to `npm run dev`. These are the
# placeholders the later milestones (real integrations) will use.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# App
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME="Lead Gen Engine"
SESSION_SECRET="dev-only-change-me"

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DATABASE (optional). Leave unset → the app runs on mock data.
# Set it → the Lead Database + CRM read from Postgres via Prisma.
#
# Easiest: create a free project at https://neon.tech and paste the
# connection string here, then run:  npm run db:setup   (push + seed)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:pass@ep-xxx.neon.tech/leadgen?sslmode=require"

# --- Later milestones (not used yet) ---
# REDIS_URL="redis://localhost:6379"
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=""
# OPENAI_API_KEY=""
# GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=""
# SERPAPI_KEY=""
